\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.  \cf0 We dedicate now, Lord, to Thee
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj this house, may it Thy dwelling be,
\par for us a sacred heaven.
\par We implore thee to bless this house;
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj Vouchsafe O Lord to keep it still
\par For thine glory and reverence.
\par Reign Thou, dwell now make us worthy
\par here to serve Thee, Lord of glory!
\par Bless this house we do implore Thee!
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Lord, let this house of worship be
\par now dedicated unto Thee,
\par To Thee may it be pleasing
\par Here let be heard Thy living word.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Thy grace here on us be conferr'd
\par within this hall of blessing.
\par Oneness, pureness our endeavour,
\par may it ever be our striving,
\par thus new strength and peace deriving.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

